  Slug: vanguard-of-roaring-waters
  DisplayName: Vanguard of Roaring Waters
  IconPath: icons/magic/water/water-jet-wave-blue.webp
  Description: 'Vanguards of roaring waters are found where rivers carve their way
    through mountains, creating fearsome rapids. They can also be found near bays
    where rivers meet the sea and create turbulent breakers and unpredictable undertows,
    coastal reefs that tear the bottoms from unwary ships and isolate islands, or
    anywhere else where water becomes violent and difficult to navigate safely. Vanguards
    of roaring waters encourage chaos and are easily bored. Apparition Skills Mountain
    Lore, River Lore Apparition Spells Cantrip @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Rousing
    Splash] 1st @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Hydraulic Push] 2nd @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mist]
    3rd @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Crashing Wave] 4th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Hydraulic
    Torrent] 5th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Control Water] 6th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Personal
    Ocean] 7th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Dancing Fountain] 8th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Whirlpool]
    9th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wrathful Storm] Vessel Spell @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.River
    Carving Mountains] Avatar River that Splits the World Speed 50 feet, swim Speed
    70 feet Melee 1 parting mountains (reach 15 feet, versatile S, water), Damage
    @Damage[(6d10+6)[bludgeoning]] Ranged 1 crash into the sea (range 120 feet, versatile
    P, water), Damage @Damage[(6d6+6)[bludgeoning]]'
